---
import katex from 'katex';
const { lang = 'zh' } = Astro.props;
const isZh = lang !== 'en';
const render = (s) => katex.renderToString(s,{displayMode:true,throwOnError:false,strict:false});
const steps = isZh ? [
  ['1｜從平均量回到總位移','Average velocity 乘上 interval 長度，就是這段路徑的總位移。',String.raw`(t-r)u(z_t,r,t)=\int_r^t v(z_\tau,\tau)\,d\tau`,'先把「平均」還原成「累積量」，才方便對 endpoint 做微分。'],
  ['2｜對右端點 t 微分','固定 r。右側依微積分基本定理，對上限 t 微分後得到當下 velocity。',String.raw`\frac{d}{dt}\left[(t-r)u\right]=v(z_t,t)`,'把區間延長一個很小的 dt，新增加的位移約等於 v(t)dt。'],
  ['3｜Product rule','左側的 (t-r) 與 u 都會隨 t 改變，因此必須用乘法法則。',String.raw`\frac{d}{dt}\left[(t-r)u\right]=u+(t-r)\frac{du}{dt}`,String.raw`\boxed{v=u+(t-r)\frac{du}{dt}}`],
  ['4｜為什麼是 total derivative？','u 真正的輸入是 (z_t,r,t)。當 t 改變時，z_t 也會沿 flow 移動；r 在此固定。',String.raw`\frac{du}{dt}=\frac{\partial u}{\partial z}\frac{dz_t}{dt}+\frac{\partial u}{\partial r}\frac{dr}{dt}+\frac{\partial u}{\partial t}`,'這裡不能只看 ∂u/∂t，因為 state z_t 也正在變。'],
  ['5｜代入 flow 的移動方向','Flow ODE 給出 dz_t/dt=v，而固定 r 代表 dr/dt=0。',String.raw`\frac{dz_t}{dt}=v,\qquad \frac{dr}{dt}=0\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\frac{du}{dt}=\partial_z u\,v+\partial_tu`,'第一項是 state motion，第二項是 time 本身造成的變化。'],
  ['6｜JVP 從哪裡來？','把 network input 寫成 q(t)=(z_t,r,t)。Chain rule 可直接寫成 Jacobian 乘上 q 的 tangent。',String.raw`q'(t)=\left[v,0,1\right],\qquad\frac{du}{dt}=J_u(q)\,q'(t)`,String.raw`\boxed{\operatorname{JVP}(u;v)=J_u(z,r,t)[v,0,1]=\partial_z u\,v+\partial_tu}`]
] : [
  ['1 | Recover displacement','Average velocity times interval length is the accumulated displacement.',String.raw`(t-r)u(z_t,r,t)=\int_r^t v(z_\tau,\tau)\,d\tau`,'Convert the average quantity back into an accumulated quantity before differentiating the endpoint.'],
  ['2 | Differentiate the endpoint','Hold r fixed. By the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus, differentiating the upper limit t gives the instantaneous velocity.',String.raw`\frac{d}{dt}\left[(t-r)u\right]=v(z_t,t)`,'Extending the interval by a tiny dt adds approximately v(t)dt of displacement.'],
  ['3 | Product rule','Both (t-r) and u change with t, so the left side uses the product rule.',String.raw`\frac{d}{dt}\left[(t-r)u\right]=u+(t-r)\frac{du}{dt}`,String.raw`\boxed{v=u+(t-r)\frac{du}{dt}}`],
  ['4 | Why a total derivative?','The true inputs are (z_t,r,t). When t changes, z_t also moves along the flow while r is fixed.',String.raw`\frac{du}{dt}=\frac{\partial u}{\partial z}\frac{dz_t}{dt}+\frac{\partial u}{\partial r}\frac{dr}{dt}+\frac{\partial u}{\partial t}`,'We cannot keep only ∂u/∂t because the state z_t is moving too.'],
  ['5 | Substitute the flow direction','The flow ODE gives dz_t/dt=v and holding r fixed gives dr/dt=0.',String.raw`\frac{dz_t}{dt}=v,\qquad \frac{dr}{dt}=0\quad\Longrightarrow\quad\frac{du}{dt}=\partial_z u\,v+\partial_tu`,'The first term is state motion; the second is explicit time dependence.'],
  ['6 | Where the JVP comes from','Write the network input as q(t)=(z_t,r,t). The chain rule is Jacobian times the tangent of q.',String.raw`q'(t)=\left[v,0,1\right],\qquad\frac{du}{dt}=J_u(q)\,q'(t)`,String.raw`\boxed{\operatorname{JVP}(u;v)=J_u(z,r,t)[v,0,1]=\partial_z u\,v+\partial_tu}`]
];
---
<div class="derivation" data-derivation data-lang={isZh?'zh':'en'}>
  <div class="derivation-head"><strong>{isZh?'MeanFlow Identity｜從積分一路推到 JVP':'MeanFlow Identity | from integral to JVP'}</strong><div class="controls"><button data-prev>{isZh?'上一步':'Prev'}</button><button data-play>{isZh?'播放':'Play'}</button><button data-next>{isZh?'下一步':'Next'}</button></div></div>
  <div class="progress">{steps.map(()=><i></i>)}</div>
  {steps.map((s,i)=><section data-step={i} hidden={i!==0}><span class="step-label">{s[0]}</span><p class="why">{s[1]}</p><div class="math-box" set:html={render(s[2])}></div>{s[3] && (s[3].includes('\\')||s[3].includes('\boxed')) ? <div class="math-box secondary" set:html={render(s[3])}></div> : <p class="takeaway">{s[3]}</p>}</section>)}
</div>
<style>
.derivation{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:1rem;padding:1rem;margin:1.2rem 0;background:var(--rh-surface);overflow:hidden}.derivation-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:1rem;align-items:center}.controls{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,6.2rem));gap:.45rem}.controls button{width:100%;height:2.5rem;border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:.55rem;background:var(--rh-surface-2);color:var(--rh-text);font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.controls button:disabled{opacity:.45}.progress{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.3rem;margin:.8rem 0}.progress i{height:4px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--rh-border)}.progress i.active{background:var(--rh-coffee)}.derivation section{min-height:18rem;border-top:1px solid var(--rh-border);padding-top:.9rem}.step-label{display:block;color:var(--rh-caramel);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.05em;font-weight:800}.why{font-weight:650;line-height:1.6}.math-box{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;overflow-y:hidden;border:1px solid var(--rh-border);border-radius:.7rem;background:var(--rh-surface-2);padding:.65rem .8rem;margin:.65rem 0}.math-box :global(.katex-display){width:max-content;min-width:100%;margin:.2rem 0}.math-box.secondary{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rh-caramel) 7%,var(--rh-surface-2))}.takeaway{border-left:3px solid var(--rh-caramel);padding:.65rem .8rem;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--rh-caramel) 6%,transparent);border-radius:.35rem;line-height:1.6}
@media(max-width:720px){.derivation-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.controls{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));max-width:none}.derivation section{min-height:20rem}}
</style>
<script>
for(const root of document.querySelectorAll('[data-derivation]')){if(root.dataset.ready)continue;root.dataset.ready='1';const steps=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-step]')],bars=[...root.querySelectorAll('.progress i')],prev=root.querySelector('[data-prev]'),next=root.querySelector('[data-next]'),play=root.querySelector('[data-play]');const zh=root.dataset.lang==='zh';let idx=0,timer=null;function render(){steps.forEach((s,i)=>s.hidden=i!==idx);bars.forEach((b,i)=>b.classList.toggle('active',i<=idx));prev.disabled=idx===0;next.disabled=idx===steps.length-1}function stop(){if(timer){clearInterval(timer);timer=null}play.textContent=zh?'播放':'Play'}prev.addEventListener('click',()=>{stop();idx=Math.max(0,idx-1);render()});next.addEventListener('click',()=>{stop();idx=Math.min(steps.length-1,idx+1);render()});play.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(timer){stop();return}play.textContent=zh?'暫停':'Pause';timer=setInterval(()=>{if(idx>=steps.length-1){stop();return}idx++;render()},3000)});render()}
</script>
